Wolf sniffed a pasty. Fie, mushrooms. He kept on trotting and vanished after the turn. And later two woodcutters appeared on the path, walking out of the bushes. They see a nice good smelling pasty on the grass. They split it in two parts and ate.
-Look, it seems, Wolf tracks! - exclaimed the first one.
-Yeah, right! Let's catch him. - offered the other one.
So it was decided.